Chapter: CleanZombiesScript

  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe
  cites Shell chapter ShellTypes
  cites Shell chapter ShellBuild
  cites Shell chapter PowerShellEmit

 We say:

Section: Parameters

  cleanzombies-params : List ShellParam = [sh-doc ["Fleet-wide: kill every codex-vm and QEMU on the box and shut down WSL,", "the pre-2026-08-28 behaviour. WITHOUT it the sweep is scoped to VMs whose", "command line references THIS workspace, because a bare run during another", "agent's gate is friendly fire: it killed three gates in one day. A foreign", "agent's VM, a bare WSL bridge and vmmemWSL all survive a scoped run; your", "own GDB bridge names your repo path and is yours, so it does not."] (sh-switch "All")]

Section: S01 -- Init

 No ScSetStrictMode and no ScSetErrorStop, which every other generator here
 emits. Under Stop, `& wsl.exe --shutdown` becomes a terminating error the
 moment a shell has PSNativeCommandUseErrorActionPreference on, and this is
 the tool reached for when the machine is already wedged. It has to run to
 the end on a box where things are failing; that is its whole job.

  s01 : List ShellCmd = [ScAssign "killed" (SeRaw "$false"), ScAssign "repo" (SeRaw "(Resolve-Path (Join-Path $PSScriptRoot '..')).Path")]

Section: S02 -- Kill VM and WSL Processes

  s02-codexvm-signal : List ShellCmd = [ScForEach "p" (SeVar "procs") [ScRaw "$evtName = \"Global\\CodexVmShutdown_$($p.Id)\"", ScTry [ScRaw "$evt = [System.Threading.EventWaitHandle]::OpenExisting($evtName)", ScRaw "$evt.Set() | Out-Null", ScRaw "$evt.Dispose()"] [] []], ScRaw "Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 3000"]

  s02-portfwd-spare : List ShellCmd = [ScComment "Spare long-running SERVER VMs (webservices booted with -portfwd,", ScComment "e.g. apps/ideas). Compile/test VMs never use -portfwd, so any", ScComment "codex-vm with it on the command line is deliberately serving,", ScComment "not an orphan. Killing it breaks another agent's live demo.", ScRaw "$procs = @($procs | Where-Object {", ScRaw "$cl = (Get-CimInstance Win32_Process -Filter \"ProcessId=$($_.Id)\" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).CommandLine", ScRaw "\"$cl\" -notlike '*-portfwd*'", ScRaw "})"]

  s02-kill-remaining : List ShellCmd = [ScRaw "$procs | Where-Object { -not $_.HasExited } | ForEach-Object { Stop-Process -Id $_.Id -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }", ScAssign "killed" (SeRaw "$true")]

  s02-own-scope : List ShellCmd = [ScComment "Ownership scope (default): only processes whose command line names", ScComment "THIS workspace are ours to kill. Another agent's VM never matches;", ScComment "a bare wsl bridge never matches; your own GDB bridge does. -All", ScComment "restores the fleet-wide sweep.", ScRaw "$procs = @($procs | Where-Object {", ScRaw "$cl = (Get-CimInstance Win32_Process -Filter \"ProcessId=$($_.Id)\" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).CommandLine", ScRaw "\"$cl\" -like \"*$repo*\"", ScRaw "})"]

  s02 : List ShellCmd = [ScForEach "name" (SeArrayLiteral [SeLit "qemu-system-x86_64", SeLit "codex-vm", SeLit "wsl"]) [ScRaw "$procs = Get-Process -Name $name -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue", ScIf (SeAnd (SeStringEq (SeVar "name") (SeLit "codex-vm")) (SeVar "procs")) s02-portfwd-spare [], ScIf (SeAnd (SeNot (SeVar "All")) (SeVar "procs")) s02-own-scope [], ScIf (SeVar "procs") [ScIf (SeStringEq (SeVar "name") (SeLit "codex-vm")) s02-codexvm-signal [], ScSequence s02-kill-remaining] []]]

Section: S03 -- WSL Shutdown

  s03 : List ShellCmd = [ScIf (SeAnd (SeVar "All") (SeRaw "(Get-Process -Name vmmemWSL -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)")) [ScRaw "& wsl.exe --shutdown 2>$null | Out-Null", ScAssign "killed" (SeRaw "$true")] []]

Section: S04 -- Summary

  s04 : List ShellCmd = [ScAssign "scope" (SeRaw "if ($All) { 'fleet-wide' } else { 'this workspace only' }"), ScIf (SeVar "killed") [ScRaw "Write-Output \"clean-zombies: done ($scope)\""] [ScRaw "Write-Output \"clean-zombies: nothing to do ($scope)\""]]

Section: Assembly

  cleanzombies-body : List ShellCmd = [ScSequence s01, ScBlank, ScSequence s02, ScBlank, ScSequence s03, ScBlank, ScSequence s04]

  cleanzombies-script : ShellScript = sh-script "clean-zombies" "Purge orphaned VM and WSL bridge processes" cleanzombies-params cleanzombies-body

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (emit-powershell cleanzombies-script)
  end

